"\n"
"Context: Save learning artifact character tag\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Dominant character tag is filled in while the artifact is marked as "
"not clearly evident\n"
"Solution: Clear the dominant character tag or uncheck Not Clearly Evident\n"
