"Terlihat\n"

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact_character
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact_character.field_school_learning_artifact__allowed_indicator_ids
msgid ""
"Active indicators of an active sub-construct that can be selected. When a "
"status line applies to the grade of the artifact, only the indicators that "
"are Effective or Partial on those lines are listed."
msgstr ""
"Indikator aktif dari sub-konstruk aktif yang dapat dipilih. Bila baris "
"status berlaku untuk tingkat artefak, hanya indikator yang berstatus Efektif "
"atau Sebagian pada baris tersebut yang ditampilkan."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact_character
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact_character.field_school_learning_artifact__allowed_subconstruct_ids
msgid ""
"Active sub-constructs that can be tagged. When the grade type of the "
"artifact has indicator statuses, only the sub-constructs with an Effective "
"or Partial indicator at that grade type are listed."
msgstr ""
"Sub-konstruk aktif yang dapat ditandai. Bila jenjang sekolah artefak memiliki "
"status indikator, hanya sub-konstruk dengan indikator Efektif atau Sebagian "
"pada jenjang sekolah tersebut yang ditampilkan."

