msgstr "Indikator karakter tempat status ini berlaku."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact_character
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact_character.field_school_learning_artifact__character_indicator_ids
msgid ""
"The character indicators that appear in this artifact. Each indicator "
"belongs to the dominant or the secondary character tag. It is a mark of the "
"activity, not evidence of the character achievement of a student."
msgstr ""
"Indikator karakter yang muncul dalam artefak ini. Setiap indikator termasuk "
"dalam tag karakter dominan atau sekunder. Ini adalah penanda aktivitas, "
"bukan bukti capaian karakter siswa."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact_character
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact_character.field_school_learning_artifact__primary_subconstruct_id
msgid ""
"The character sub-construct that dominates this artifact. It is a tag of the "
"activity, not evidence of the character achievement of a student."
msgstr ""
"Sub-konstruk karakter yang mendominasi artefak ini. Ini adalah tag kegiatan, "
"bukan bukti pencapaian karakter seorang siswa."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact_character
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact_character.field_school_character_indicator_grade_status__grade_type_id
msgid "The grade type at which the indicator has this status."
msgstr "Jenjang sekolah tempat indikator memiliki status ini."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact_character
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact_character.field_school_character_indicator_grade_status__grade_ids
msgid ""
"The grades of the grade type at which the indicator has this status. Leave "
"empty to apply the status to every grade of the grade type."
msgstr ""
"Tingkat dari jenjang sekolah tempat indikator memiliki status ini. Kosongkan "
"untuk menerapkan status ke setiap tingkat dari jenjang sekolah tersebut."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact_character
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact_character.field_school_character_indicator__grade_status_ids
msgid ""
"The status of this indicator per grade type. Leave empty when the school "
"does not filter character tags by grade type."
msgstr ""
"Status indikator ini per jenjang sekolah. Kosongkan bila sekolah tidak "
"menyaring tag karakter menurut jenjang sekolah."
